Why Did We Establish Animal Cancer Centre?\n(English Subtitle Available)\nRadiation Therapy (RT) Workflow\nAt Harvest Veterinary Oncology Centre (HVOC) and Harvest Veterinary Specialty & Emergency Hospital (HVSEH), we provide comprehensive and high-quality veterinary specialist and care services for animals such as cats and dogs, including: oncology, anesthesia and pain management, cardiology, dentistry and oral surgery, surgery, 24-hour emergency and critical care. We believe that all animal lives are equal, and we strive to offer the best medical services to bring a ray of hope to every patient.\nContact us\nPhone:  3426 3500\n24-hour Emergency Service Hotline:: 3102 8528\nService Hours (Please make an appointment)\nMonday to Sunday\n09:00 - 19:00\nShop 1, G/F, Magnet Place Tower 2, 38-42 Kwai Fung Crescent, Kwai Chung\nEmergency Room Service Hours\nMonday to Sunday\n24-hour\nShop 2, G/F (Emergency Room); 9/F (Specialty Service), Magnet Place Tower 2, 38-42 Kwai Fung Crescent, Kwai Chung\nCopyright © 2025 Harvest Veterinary Oncology Centre (HVOC) | Harvest Veterinary Specialty & Emergency Hospital (HVSEH)\nScroll to Top",
